.IX Title "DTN2ADMINEP 1"
.TH DTN2ADMINEP 1 2025-11-26 "perl v5.38.2" "BP executables"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
dtn2adminep \- administrative endpoint task for the "dtn" scheme
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBdtn2adminep\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBdtn2adminep\fR is a background "daemon" task that receives and processes
administrative bundles (minimally, all bundle status reports) that are
sent to the "dtn"\-scheme administrative endpoint on the local ION node,
if and only if such an endpoint was established by \fBbpadmin\fR.  It is
spawned automatically by \fBbpadmin\fR in response to the 's' (START)
command that starts operation of Bundle Protocol on the local
ION node, and it is terminated by \fBbpadmin\fR in response to an 'x' (STOP)
command.  \fBdtn2adminep\fR can also be spawned and terminated in response to
START and STOP commands that pertain specifically to the "dtn" scheme.
.PP
\&\fBdtn2adminep\fR responds to bundle status reports by logging ASCII text
messages describing the reported activity.
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.IX Header "EXIT STATUS"
.IP """0""" 4
.IX Item """0"""
\&\fBdtn2adminep\fR terminated, for reasons noted in the \fBion.log\fR file.  If this
termination was not commanded, investigate and solve the problem identified
in the log file and use \fBbpadmin\fR to restart \fBdtn2adminep\fR.
.IP """1""" 4
.IX Item """1"""
\&\fBdtn2adminep\fR was unable to attach to Bundle Protocol operations or was
unable to load the "dtn" scheme database, probably because \fBbpadmin\fR has
not yet been run.
.SH FILES
.IX Header "FILES"
No configuration files are needed.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.IX Header "ENVIRONMENT"
No environment variables apply.
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
.IX Header "DIAGNOSTICS"
The following diagnostics may be issued to the \fBion.log\fR log file:
.IP "dtn2adminep can't attach to BP." 4
.IX Item "dtn2adminep can't attach to BP."
\&\fBbpadmin\fR has not yet initialized BP operations.
.IP "dtn2adminep can't load routing database." 4
.IX Item "dtn2adminep can't load routing database."
\&\fBdtn2admin\fR has not yet initialized the "dtn" scheme.
.IP "dtn2adminep can't get admin EID." 4
.IX Item "dtn2adminep can't get admin EID."
\&\fBdtn2admin\fR has not yet initialized the "dtn" scheme.
.IP "dtn2adminep crashed." 4
.IX Item "dtn2adminep crashed."
An unrecoverable database error was encountered.  \fBdtn2adminep\fR terminates.
.SH BUGS
.IX Header "BUGS"
Report bugs to <https://github.com/nasa\-jpl/ION\-DTN/issues>
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBbpadmin\fR\|(1), \fBdtn2admin\fR\|(1).
